<% content_for :title, "OmaDB — does Omarchy run on it?" %>
<main class="frame">
  <header class="bar">
    <span class="brand">omadb</span>
    <span class="muted">the hardware list Omarchy never had</span>
  </header>

  <form class="prompt" action="/" role="search">
    <label for="q">❯</label>
    <input id="q" name="q" placeholder="thinkpad t14" autocomplete="off" autofocus disabled>
  </form>
  <p class="muted small">Search opens when the first reports land. Press nothing yet.</p>

  <section class="counters" aria-label="Catalog">
    <div><b class="g-verified">●</b> <%= @counts.fetch("verified", 0) %> verified</div>
    <div><b class="g-predicted">◐</b> <%= @counts.fetch("predicted", 0) %> predicted</div>
    <div><b class="g-unverified">○</b> <%= @counts.fetch("unverified", 0) %> unverified</div>
    <div><b class="g-disputed">~</b> <%= @counts.fetch("disputed", 0) %> disputed</div>
  </section>

  <pre class="box" aria-label="Tiers">┌─ tiers ────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ <span class="t-platinum">● platinum</span>  out of the box. nothing to do.             │
│ <span class="t-gold">● gold    </span>  one documented tweak, linked.              │
│ <span class="t-silver">● silver  </span>  daily-drivable. something minor is broken. │
│ <span class="t-bronze">● bronze  </span>  a core feature needs a hack.               │
│ <span class="t-borked">● borked  </span>  won't install or boot.                     │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘</pre>

  <p>Every machine gets a page before anyone reports it. <b class="g-predicted">◐</b> predictions come from the
    parts inside it (wifi chip, audio codec, GPU) and the machines those parts already work on, never from
    "it looks like a ThinkPad". A prediction tops out at gold. Platinum takes a human.</p>

  <pre class="box" aria-label="Reporter">┌─ report your machine (soon) ────────────────────┐
│ $ curl -fsSL omadb.technoir.cloud/report | bash │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘</pre>
  <p class="muted small">Shows you the script and the payload, asks y/N, needs no account. Works from the live ISO,
    so machines that never made it past install count too.</p>
</main>
